作的部件。该机构由多个部件组成，其中某一部件通过旋转运动驱动其他部分。回转动作指围绕固定轴线做圆周运动，需明确各部件在机构中的连接方式与运动特性。滑杆和滑块主要参与直线往复运动，机体作为支撑结构保持静止。回转体并非标准术语。曲柄作为主动件，一端与旋转轴相连，另一端与滑块铰接，自身完成连续旋转。通过判断各部件的运动轨迹与自由度，可确定执行回转动作的部件。</p>","sc":2.0,"kp":["凸轮、滑杆、棘轮、曲柄、连杆等特殊结构","如何区分不同的曲柄连杆机构"]},{"i":"1939954266917490690","no":23,"t":1,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">如图，关于该图片说法正确的是？（ ）</span></p><p><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-48-10/8628295182888189952.jpeg\" alt=\"\" data-href=\"\" style=\"\"/></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">这是皮带传动</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">这是链传动</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">这是齿轮垂直啮合</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">a和b轮的转向相反</span></p>"}],"a":"D","an":"","sc":2.0,"kp":["凸轮、滑杆、棘轮、曲柄、蜗轮蜗杆等特殊结构在生活中的应用","凸轮、滑杆、棘轮、曲柄、连杆等特殊结构"]},{"i":"1939954389718323201","no":24,"t":1,"s":"<p><span style=\"font-family: 宋体;\">下列哪个是齿式棘轮机构？（ ）</span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-48-45/8628295327587459072.jpeg\" alt=\"24A.jpeg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-48-45/8628295327587459072.jpeg\" style=\"\"/></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-48-50/8628295349825658880.jpeg\" alt=\"24B.jpeg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-48-50/8628295349825658880.jpeg\" style=\"\"/></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-48-55/8628295369455001600.jpeg\" alt=\"24C.jpeg\" data-href=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-48-55/8628295369455001600.jpeg\" style=\"\"/></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2025-07-01-15-49-01/8628295395669401600.jpeg\" alt=\"24D.jpeg\" data-href=\"https://min